version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-09-26
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/AI-Proof/shadow-hypothesis-ledger"
abstract: "Keeps rejected inferences about a person out of an AI agent's prompt. Rejected guesses are stored locally, shown to the model by id only, refused if re-added under another id, and restored only by the person's explicit re-consent."
keywords:
  - ai-agents
  - agent-memory
  - consent
  - privacy
